IMAP

A Plug-In for Mill. Put it in the "Mill Plug-Ins" folder.

  imap://user@host/                    The mailboxes
  imap://user@host/mailbox             Its messages, newest first
  imap://user@host/mailbox?search      Those a search finds (FROM eric)
  imap://user@host/mailbox/;UID=n      A message

Internet Message Access Protocol (IMAP4 and IMAP4rev1), with a plain LOGIN.
Read-only: mailboxes are opened with EXAMINE and messages read with
BODY.PEEK, so reading one doesn't mark it read. Unread messages are in bold.
The text part is shown (quoted-printable and base64 decoded); other parts
are named, not shown. Mill asks for the password.

plugin://imap/about has a form, filled in from Settings.

Written from the published specifications (RFC 1730, 2060, 2192, 822,
1522, 2045, and 2046).

Build: ./build.sh writes build/IMAP.bin.
